00EE                             ; The first page ends somewhere among the next four handlers, ] \ [ @ (they
00EE                             ; are in falling code order for this), and where exactly differs between the
00EE                             ; builds: NPG1 follows. Every handler below these four must start in the
00EE                             ; second page, and every one above in the first; chktab.py checks both.
00EE                             ; "]" returns: pop an address and jump to it.
