00FF                             ; uppercase is a word, lowercase a variable. Followed by a space it pushes
00FF                             ; the body"s address instead. Either way it then skips to the matching "]'.
00FF                             ; (The unchecked build takes anything that is not a letter as the space; the
00FF                             ; checked build stops on it.)
